  TextFields:
  - ' Hercules and the Dragon'
  - "A,\n\nYou are solving the puzzles! I worked on those puzzles for months\u2014but
    you know me, I hate puzzles. The first 9 stations is online, and everything\u2019s
    syncing up. I'm headed through Michigan and will be back to you soon.\n\nIf you
    can get through the next two puzzles, the satellite decryption will unlock. 
    It\u2019ll change everything\u2014messaging, data, even long-range comms. No
    more waiting weeks to hear from each other or dealing with the Office of Signal
    Integrity (OSI)  - or the Office of Spies and Interference....\n\nTime to face
    the dragon\u2026\n\n\u2014E"
